What is printed by this labeled `continue` statement?
```java
outer: for (int i = 1; i <= 2; i++) {
    for (int j = 1; j <= 3; j++) {
        if (j == 2) continue outer;
        System.out.print(i + "" + j + " ");
    }
}
```

